WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.090
At a water park, two smooth slides start
from the same platform and end at the

2
00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:06.530
same pool.

3
00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:08.680
One plunges steeply.

4
00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:11.900
The other slopes gently, a long way out.

5
00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:16.560
Friction is negligible on both,
and you start from rest each time.

6
00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:19.490
Which slide sends you
into the pool faster?

7
00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:22.140
In this mission, you'll
meet kinetic energy,

8
00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:25.390
and find out what doubling
your speed does to it.

9
00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:31.230
Then you'll drop a ball from 1.8 m, and
predict its speed as it reaches the floor.

10
00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:35.210
Your mission: predict which slide
sends you into the pool faster,

11
00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:36.440
and explain why.
